{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Entity: Midnight\u2019s Watcher</strong> is a spine-chilling FPS horror game that follows Alex, who revisits his old farmhouse after a long time, only to discover that something evil has taken hold of the land. Each night, Alex faces strange and terrifying encounters, reminiscent of Slender Man \u2014 but as the days pass, the horror becomes increasingly personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407460/extras/Point.png?t=1741970194\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407460/extras/Gif.gif?t=1741970194\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a Tense, Atmospheric World</strong>: Dive into eerie environments filled with unsettling details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel Dark Secrets</strong>: Discover hidden clues and piece together fragments of Alex's troubled past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Storytelling</strong>: Experience a gripping narrative that blends nostalgia with growing dread.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Suspenseful Gameplay</strong>: Encounter unnerving events and psychological tension that keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short Yet Haunting</strong>: A bite-sized introduction to the horrors awaiting in the full game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you withstand the fear? Try the demo now!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407460?t=1741970194","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407460/cc251ef8b14b13bdffdee68b8281955047019f80/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741970194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co